{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20075","headline":"酬友人见寄新文 · 孟郊","name":"酬友人见寄新文","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲客栖未定，况当玄月中。\n繁云翳碧霄，落雪和清风。\n郊陌绝行人，原隰多飞蓬。\n耕牛返村巷，野鸟依房栊。\n我无饥冻忧，身托莲花宫。\n安闲赖禅伯，复得疏尘蒙。\n览君郢曲文，词彩何冲融。\n讴吟不能已，顿觉形神空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}